---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---

<section id="about" class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20">
	<div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-6xl gap-10 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center lg:px-8">
		<div class="lg:col-span-7">
			<p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-secondary">About Skyline Excavating</p>
			<h2 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">
				Clean, organized professionalism on every project.
			</h2>
			<p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
				Skyline Excavating is owner-operated, which means your project is led directly by the same person who quotes the work and
				coordinates the schedule. You get clear communication, realistic timelines, and personal accountability from start to finish.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
				For larger scopes, trusted partner operators are coordinated as needed so the quality and pace stay consistent without losing
				a single point of contact.
			</p>
		</div>

		<aside class="lg:col-span-5">
			<div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-canvas shadow-card">
				<Image
					src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504307651254-35680f356dfd?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80"
					alt="Owner-operator on an active excavation job site"
					width={1000}
					height={700}
					class="h-56 w-full object-cover"
				/>
				<div class="p-6">
					<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Owner Spotlight</h3>
					<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
						"Every job gets direct attention, organized execution, and honest communication. The goal is always to leave the site
						ready for the next trade and the client confident in the result."
					</p>
					<p class="mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-primary">Owner, Skyline Excavating</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</aside>
	</div>
</section>
